PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Linear Chain
    - v0 → v1 → v2 → v3 → v4
    - Straight horizontal line of nodes
    - Nodes: circles, 100px diameter
  L2: Deterministic Arrows
    - Single arrow between each node
    - Labels: "a1", "a2", "a3", "a4"
  L3: Labels
    - "Duty Chain"
    - "No branching permitted"
  L4: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "Procedural rigidity"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
